+Reader: Codex, independent review seat, fresh context, 2026-10-11. Scope: chapters 16–30 only. Each chapter below was printed in full with numbered lines and read in order. Scene boundaries are the manuscript's `---` breaks; the quoted boundary words preserve manuscript punctuation and markdown.
